OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunshine and showers on
OL,6,FThursday. Showers turning thundery at
OL,7,Ftimes as they move their way
OL,8,Feastwards. Some hail possible too.
OL,9,FSlightly cooler than Wednesday and
OL,10,Frather breezy, but warm in any sunny
OL,11,Fspells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers reducing in number
OL,14,Fduring the evening but some continuing
OL,15,Fovernight, chiefly around western
OL,16,Fcoasts where they could still be heavy
OL,17,Fand thundery. Clear spells elsewhere
OL,18,Fand winds falling lighter.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,172,160,301,260,100,100
